          "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 26 2023 18:47:52 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Osteopenic screws</span></span><br>\n<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">All 3Di screw holes accept 4.0mm and 5.5mm non-locking and polyaxial locking screws.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Osteopenic thread profile</span></span><br>\n<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Designed for purchase in poor quality bone with increased minor diameter.</span></span></p>\n",
